5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a logical way to handle the shortage. I'll check the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows to understand the physical layout and usage.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I want to understand the financial side of this. I'll look into the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I'll look into the sticker register and the daily riders, as well as the five years of association minutes, to see how things have been handled in the past.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at last year's complaint log entries and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary. It's always enlightening to see where things actually fall apart.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,I want to see how much work this actually is! I'll check the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the sticker register and the daily riders.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
